    dcterms:source "Colours taken automatically from the face materials of skytrain/out/mk1/skytrain_mk1.obj (area share of the painted surface, kept when >= 1.5%, white/grey/black when >= 20%; the colour samples keep them all; tools/extract_colors.py)"@en ;
